      "chunk_id": "text_14",
      "quote": "Univariate Meta-Regression Analyses ARTICLE IN PRESS Table 2 presents the results of univariate meta-regression analyses examining metabolic risk factors as predictors of standardised PSS scores across the combined dataset.",
